        "summary": "Nd9 cluster 1 shows ligand-sensitized NIR Nd3+ emission (877, 1064, 1338 nm) plus ligand-centered visible emission at 599 nm. Intrinsic Nd quantum yield is 3.64% and overall NIR Φem is 0.62% (ηsens = 17.03%). NIR intensity at 1064 nm is enhanced by Cd2+/Zn2+ and quenched by Cu2+/Co2+ and nitro explosives, with ppm-level LODs for Cd2+, Zn2+, Cu2+, Co2+ and HMX.",
